Claude Code: curation runs through the CLI. It asks before skillhub commands that change the hub,
its connections, the token or the cache (init, connect, doctor --fix, serve, token rotate, cache
clear, and commands with --yes or confirm); --approve-content is blocked. First opening this folder
shows a trust dialog listing Bash(skillhub:*).

To write these files, run:
  $ skillhub connect <WORKSPACE> --global --host claude-code --host codex-cli --host gemini-cli
